                    <chunk name="param_input" index="1">
                      <items count="6">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Name of unique load case for which to retrieve results. Can be a load case combination name or a load case combination name and load case index. By default, the first load case of the first load case combination is chosen. If no input is provided, the results for the default load case are retrieved. The default load case is either the one selected by the nearest upstream component or the first active load case if no load case selection has been made. If you're unsure about the current default load case, you can connect the model to a panel, which will display the relevant information.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">24ef0894-c64f-4af8-9767-dd7eeb6d1737</item>
